  "id": "5c73cf711acf7e7e96558ac4",
  "title": "肉末豇豆扮米粉|日日食,好时光",
  "summary": "朋友们，又到了更新家常菜日志的休闲时光了。 我还是一如既往地在好好吃饭噢。 给自己点个赞，嘿嘿。 肉末豇豆扮米粉 我其实并不是个喜欢做饭的人。但是做饭似乎总是占据我生活的很大比例。 经常做饭会使我变得脾气烦躁，所以，在晚上我也常常煮面条或是抄手草草打发一餐，这样就可以不做米饭了。 由于，橘子吃面条容易出现烧心他不大喜欢，所以近年来吃米粉的次数很多很多。 虽然说着草草打发一餐米粉，但我还是认真地炒了肉末豇豆做米粉的浇头。 我果然还是个认真对待饮食的人呐。 草草的一餐也不那么草率了嘛~~ 无论我做得好吃或是不好吃，橘子都具有绝不BB的美德。我们的默契是\"YOU CAN YOU UP，NO CAN NO BB\". 橘子深谙绝不挑衅做饭人之道，哪怕我某日做菜大失败，菜做翻车了（太咸或是糊了），他也保持安静如鸡的状态，…",
  "content": "<p><br></p><span><span><span>朋友们，又到了更新家常菜日志的休闲时光了。</span></span></span><span><span><span>我还是一如既往地在好好吃饭噢。</span></span></span><span><span><span>给自己点个赞，嘿嘿。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>肉末豇豆扮米粉</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><div></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>我其实并不是个喜欢做饭的人。但是做饭似乎总是占据我生活的很大比例。</span></span></span><span><span><span>经常做饭会使我变得脾气烦躁，所以，在晚上我也常常煮面条或是抄手草草打发一餐，这样就可以不做米饭了。</span></span></span><span><span><span>由于，橘子吃面条容易出现烧心他不大喜欢，所以近年来吃米粉的次数很多很多。</span></span></span><span><span><span>虽然说着草草打发一餐米粉，但我还是认真地炒了肉末豇豆做米粉的浇头。</span></span></span><span><span><span>我果然还是个认真对待饮食的人呐。</span></span></span><span><span><span>草草的一餐也不那么草率了嘛~~</span></span></span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjEUEN6Ocs2zw28ZkQA6fzmzmarb466JalauaecEFR3MHBunJWV82E82ltTWJFT7tejPOlv3pUfTBFSDsdgjCJ7urklGaUQvSMdAhT89Ey4DFi2GQxjzCBB7RvQCx4qY6nGnqqFjJ9RcezPNvRU15A32g_d2hyphenhyphenNiSqCR-mSL-hER89k4twUa4wWfxpq_SGQ/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260626120802_136_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjEUEN6Ocs2zw28ZkQA6fzmzmarb466JalauaecEFR3MHBunJWV82E82ltTWJFT7tejPOlv3pUfTBFSDsdgjCJ7urklGaUQvSMdAhT89Ey4DFi2GQxjzCBB7RvQCx4qY6nGnqqFjJ9RcezPNvRU15A32g_d2hyphenhyphenNiSqCR-mSL-hER89k4twUa4wWfxpq_SGQ/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260626120802_136_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><br><br><span><span><span>无论我做得好吃或是不好吃，橘子都具有绝不BB的美德。我们的默契是&quot;YOU CAN YOU UP，NO CAN NO BB&quot;.</span></span></span><span><span><span>橘子深谙绝不挑衅做饭人之道，哪怕我某日做菜大失败，菜做翻车了（太咸或是糊了），他也保持安静如鸡的状态，默默全部吃完。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>酸菜白肉</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><div></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>这一日做的是酸菜白肉。在超市看到酸的大白菜，心血来潮，于是买了一袋回来做菜吃。</span></span></span><span><span><span>嗯……吃了以后，我表示还是更喜欢做酸菜鱼的那种由芥菜制作的酸菜。下次我决定还是买芥菜酸菜了。</span></span></span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjIM7B4FMT2qNhkecfwSEfGv995QECEPLJNwQDcixTEIXmgtyAfct5cFspJtNCRbL4EStl562Kz13aMxE_6qpCs3lkp3P4FQ69rt_vHj_ZpSrxCl_X7B2q_jLMwuXhsrtcTV_sB9ExAFobWYqGgpKFE-bqHVGaxHxxs52j7QV7Eja-ulWAujH-wC3GDl2h6/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260629180401_139_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjIM7B4FMT2qNhkecfwSEfGv995QECEPLJNwQDcixTEIXmgtyAfct5cFspJtNCRbL4EStl562Kz13aMxE_6qpCs3lkp3P4FQ69rt_vHj_ZpSrxCl_X7B2q_jLMwuXhsrtcTV_sB9ExAFobWYqGgpKFE-bqHVGaxHxxs52j7QV7Eja-ulWAujH-wC3GDl2h6/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260629180401_139_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><br><br><span><span><span>这次做出来的酸菜白肉，大家还是吃得很干净呢，谢谢捧场。</span></span></span><span><span><span>哈哈哈哈，尽管我菜做得不乍地，但大家都不挑剔，谢谢各位。</span></span></span><span><span><span>报恩的西瓜</span></span></span><p><span><span><span>今年夏天吃到的西瓜，特别好，皮薄，籽少，味道甘甜清爽，这简直是来报恩的西瓜啊。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>好西瓜，谢谢你！</span></span></span></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAbMISzEBroyyTgZrwuFyiNv7yazqyo_Hxmj9pHX8m9SqbHKfpaieKL1KwWf5HvrNXT5L0vGOqLuSdvCyFMQ0_RYiCnLbeU0pcq6PN-V9lysSnPxwnsfx5V6E8s-Gv0zAcTwmDhDmlAVkQt9w9lWlEm2SdqSE0d6l2Lvie_AwvCrPfaCnXquCFM_d-57Ak/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260629183519_143_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAbMISzEBroyyTgZrwuFyiNv7yazqyo_Hxmj9pHX8m9SqbHKfpaieKL1KwWf5HvrNXT5L0vGOqLuSdvCyFMQ0_RYiCnLbeU0pcq6PN-V9lysSnPxwnsfx5V6E8s-Gv0zAcTwmDhDmlAVkQt9w9lWlEm2SdqSE0d6l2Lvie_AwvCrPfaCnXquCFM_d-57Ak/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260629183519_143_20.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></div><br><br><p><span><span><span><span>挚友寄来的大樱桃</span></span></span></span></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiLQCtm4hA5fVFpCun_E1QGbXF6BaGqyjKXQcvRQFVuw0-xmt02PD7QojyuvuCG_Nmq8euHhBYvyJMqrBPDsiZlxd8hFQ7ltZKdNVKA6E39aUoqJUqvn_rRxIt_RS9JjiDI7pq4LYMt7_2QccfY_-7QUpTdyOg9s6InnjxqTX4uhNtscYOjvGemjArKWWNd/s1700/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260701183234_194_18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiLQCtm4hA5fVFpCun_E1QGbXF6BaGqyjKXQcvRQFVuw0-xmt02PD7QojyuvuCG_Nmq8euHhBYvyJMqrBPDsiZlxd8hFQ7ltZKdNVKA6E39aUoqJUqvn_rRxIt_RS9JjiDI7pq4LYMt7_2QccfY_-7QUpTdyOg9s6InnjxqTX4uhNtscYOjvGemjArKWWNd/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260701183234_194_18.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><br><p><span><span><span>挚友自远方寄来一箱大樱桃。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>多么鲜艳的大樱桃啊。挚友说今年雨水多，樱桃没有往年那么甜美。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我吃起来很好吃呀~当然偶尔会有一个酸的，这就像是在开盲盒，拿着鲜红的樱桃，一个一个尝试过去，看是甜是酸，这也是乐趣的一种。哈哈哈哈。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>于是，这一天晚上吃饭时，便有了餐后水果，好高级啊。</span></span></span></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNB0I_Gig_57xHC16Ig7G2dZdI0gyHzchtHYCSPjSHFkPI72mtOeduEbi_b20o_d_Xl88iSTq3P2Iz57Hn70bu-IYKinyTXd1lsPP73UaK1AR1skg4hvej8pDnZJvwB1aBo_q58Yf5y2VjHHiNNIz9JKImPVoidxm5pea8QJobRJ6cjmh8JkhZczCfEvsW/s1700/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260701183241_195_18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNB0I_Gig_57xHC16Ig7G2dZdI0gyHzchtHYCSPjSHFkPI72mtOeduEbi_b20o_d_Xl88iSTq3P2Iz57Hn70bu-IYKinyTXd1lsPP73UaK1AR1skg4hvej8pDnZJvwB1aBo_q58Yf5y2VjHHiNNIz9JKImPVoidxm5pea8QJobRJ6cjmh8JkhZczCfEvsW/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260701183241_195_18.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><br><p><span><span><span>晚餐做的是肉末豆腐，炒豆芽，配上一碗大樱桃。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>多么完美的一餐夜饭！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我长胖了果然还是有原因的。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>------</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>好了，以上就是这一回分享的普通人餐桌日志了。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>每日的饭桌上，来来回回都是很日常的家常菜。它们翻来覆去地重复出现。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>虽然普通人的生活里塞满了琐碎的、微小的、似乎不值得一提的日常，但将它们仔细记录下来，似乎能为自己的寻常日子增添几分闪闪发亮的光芒呢！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>所以，你看，我已经不知不觉记录了这么多日志啦~~~</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>今天也是好好吃饭的一天哦~~</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>谢谢各位的阅读，我们下回再见！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>【回头见】</span></span></span></p>",
